# Math Lesson Visualizer Verification Checklist

- [ ] 1. Initial State (Step 1 of Ortho lesson)
    - [ ] Screenshot captured
    - [ ] Dark background, visible grid axes, vectors visible
    - [ ] Overlay panel on left has title and description
    - [ ] No elements overlap the panel
- [ ] 2. Step 2 (Ortho lesson)
    - [ ] Click "Next"
    - [ ] Screenshot captured
    - [ ] Smooth transition
    - [ ] Math block on canvas, no overlap with left panel
- [ ] 3. Step 3 (Casting a Shadow)
    - [ ] Click "Next"
    - [ ] Screenshot captured
    - [ ] Projection vectors, dashed sunlight line, right-angle marker visible
    - [ ] Math block card visible, no overlap with left panel
- [ ] 4. Step 4 (Least Squares)
    - [ ] Click "Next"
    - [ ] Screenshot captured
    - [ ] Least squares visualization, normal equations card visible
- [ ] 5. Switch to QR Factorization
    - [ ] Lesson dropdown changed
    - [ ] Screenshot captured
    - [ ] Loaded properly
- [ ] 6. QR Lesson Progression
    - [ ] Advanced several times
    - [ ] Checked for visual issues (clipping, overlapping, missing)
- [ ] 7. Auto-advance (Play button)
    - [ ] Pressed Play
    - [ ] Screenshot captured mid-playback
- [ ] General Checks
    - [ ] Grid axes (white/bright)
    - [ ] Readable vector labels
    - [ ] Smooth overlay panel crossfade
